  "notes": "{点検|てんけん} is used for routine inspections and checks.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {点検|てんけん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{行|おこな}う→行う：01238_okonau⟧: to conduct an inspection\n- {点検|てんけん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧: to undergo inspection\n- {定期|ていき}{点検|てんけん}: regular inspection\n- ⟦{安全|あんぜん}→安全：01131_anzen⟧{点検|てんけん}: safety inspection\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{検査|けんさ}→検査：02707_kensa⟧: examination, test (more formal)\n- ⟦{確認|かくにん}→確認：00158_kakunin⟧: confirmation, verification",
